"enable them, at least for this site, or for HTTPS connections, or for 'same-"
"origin' requests."
msgstr ""
"Če je brskalnik nastavljen tako, da onemogoči glave »Referer«, jih znova "
"omogočite vsaj za to spletno mesto, za povezave HTTPS ali za zahteve »same-"
"origin«."

#: eventyay/base/views/errors.py:36
msgid ""
"You are seeing this message because this site requires a CSRF cookie when "
"submitting forms. This cookie is required for security reasons, to ensure "
"that your browser is not being hijacked by third parties."
msgstr ""
"To sporočilo je prikazano, ker to spletno mesto pri oddaji obrazcev zahteva "
"piškotek CSRF. Ta piškotek je potreben iz varnostnih razlogov, da se "
"zagotovi, da tretje osebe ne prevzamejo nadzora nad brskalnikom."

#: eventyay/base/views/errors.py:42
msgid ""
"If you have configured your browser to disable cookies, please re-enable "
"them, at least for this site, or for 'same-origin' requests."
msgstr ""
"Če je brskalnik nastavljen tako, da onemogoči piškotke, jih znova omogočite "
"vsaj za to spletno mesto ali za zahteve »same-origin«."

